    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Anchor RISK FACTORS An investment by PBCO\u2019s shareholders in Northrim common stock as a result of the exchange of shares of PBCO common stock for shares of Northrim common stock in the merger involves certain risks. Similarly, a decision on the part of Northrim shareholders to approve the Northrim share issuance also involves risks for Northrim shareholders, who will continue to hold their shares of Northrim common stock after the mergers. Certain material risks and uncertainties connected with the merger agreement and transactions contemplated thereby, including the mergers and bank merger, and ownership of Northrim common stock are discussed below. In addition, Northrim has discussed certain other material risks connected with the ownership of Northrim common stock and with Northrim\u2019s business, under the caption \u201cRisk Factors\u201d appearing in its Annual Report on Form 10-K most recently fi",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
